      "Text": "Recommended update for the Linux Kernel",
      "Title": "Topic",
      "Type": "Summary"
    },
    {
      "Text": "\nThe SUSE Linux Enterprise 16.0 kernel was updated to fix one issue\n\nThe following non security issue was fixed:\n\n- CVE-2026-46333: Fixed logic bug in the Linux kernel's __ptrace_may_access() function (bsc#1265308).\n",
      "Title": "Details",
      "Type": "General"
